OL,3,GNEWSAMurder probe launched after man
OL,4,Afatally stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a man was fatally
OL,8,Fstabbed in Staffordshire.
OL,10,FPolice were called to a crash involving
OL,11,Fa red Ford Fiesta and grey Audi on Orme
OL,12,FRoad, Newcastle-Under-Lyme, shortly
OL,13,Fafter 17:00 BST on Friday.
OL,15,FThe driver of the Fiesta, a man in his
OL,16,F20s, was found to have suffered
OL,17,Finjuries consistent with a stab wound,
OL,18,FStaffordshire Police said, and he was
OL,19,Ftaken to hospital, where he later died.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
